점 및 유통 기업입니다.","description:pt":"Fundados em 1952, são um dos dez maiores armazéns da China e uma empresa de retalho histórica e emblemática na zona comercial de Xinjiekou, em Nanquim.","description:ru":"Основанный в 1952 году, этот универмаг входит в десятку крупнейших в Китае и является историческим, знаковым крупным предприятием розничной торговли в торговом квартале Синьцзекоу в Нанкине.","description:zh":"创建于1952年，是中国十大百货商店之一，也是南京新街口商圈历史悠久的地标性大型百货零售企业。","description:zh-Hans":"创建于1952年，是中国十大百货商店之一，也是南京新街口商圈历史悠久的地标性大型百货零售企业。","description:zh-Hant":"創建於1952年，是中國十大百貨商店之一，也是南京新街口商圈歷史悠久的地標性大型百貨零售企業。","description:zh-Latn-pinyin":"Chuàngjiàn yú 1952 nián, shì Zhōngguó shídà bǎihuò shāngdiàn zhī yī, yěshì Nánjīng Xīnjiekǒu shāngquān lìshǐ yōujiǔ de dìbiāoxìng dàxíng bǎihuò língshòu qǐyè.","height":"40","internet_access":"wlan","internet_access:fee":"no","name":"南京新百","name:de":"Nanjing Xinjiekou Kaufhaus","name:en":"Nanjing Xinjiekou Department Store","name:es":"Grandes almacenes Xinjiekou de Nankín","name:fr":"Grand magasin Xinjiekou de Nankin","name:ja":"南京新百","name:ko":"난징 신바이","name:pt":"Grandes armazéns Xinjiekou de Nanquim","name:ru":"Нанкинский универмаг Синьцзекоу","name:zh":"南京新百","name:zh-Hans":"南京新百","name:zh-Hant":"南京新百","name:zh-Latn-pinyin":"Nánjīng Xīnbǎi","official_name":"南京新街口百货商店","opening_hours":"Mo-Th 10:00-22:00; Fr-Sa 10:30-22:30; Su 10:00-22:00","shop":"department_store","source":"survey;official_records","start_date":"1952","tourism":"attraction","website":"http://www.njxb.com/","wikidata":"Q11084295","wikipedia":"zh:新街口百货商场"}},{"type":"way","id":155883027,"center":{"lat":32.0438278,"lon":118.7788594},"tags":{"artwork_type":"statue","height":"11.12","historic":"memorial","material":"bronze","memorial":"statue","name":"孙中山先生像","name:en":"Statue of Mr. Sun Yat Sen","note":"孙中山铜像位于南京新街口广场的环岛中央，是中国众多孙中山铜像中最为著名的一座，也是南京的著名地标和精神象征。","tourism":"artwork"}},{"type":"way","id":156229064,"center":{"lat":32.0526902,"lon":118.7780817},"tags":{"building":"yes","name":"拉贝故居","name:en":"John Rabe House","opening_hours":"08:30-16:30","tourism":"museum"}},{"type":"way","id":167080735,"center":{"lat":32.055898,"lon":118.7645734},"tags":{"leisure":"garden","name":"中央大草坪","source":"bing"}},{"type":"way","id":167080746,"center":{"lat":32.0556433,"lon":118.763153},"tags":{"leisure":"garden","name":"德风园","source":"bing"}},{"type":"way","id":167080747,"center":{"lat":32.0559903,"lon":118.7656573},"tags":{"leisure":"garden","name":"敬文园","source":"bing"}},{"type":"way","id":167080762,"center":{"lat":32.0550047,"lon":118.7655768},"tags":{"leisure":"garden","name":"陶苑","source":"bing"}},{"type":"way","id":283029964,"center":{"lat":32.0554891,"lon":118.7483044},"tags":{"leisure":"park"}},{"type":"way","id":318052307,"center":{"lat":32.0146589,"lon":118.7765435},"tags":{"addr:city":"南京市","addr:street":"中华路","leisure":"park","name":"中华门城堡"}},{"type":"way","id":319201085,"center":{"lat":32.0408879,"lon":118.7800601},"tags":{"addr:city":"南京市","addr:district":"秦淮区","addr:housenumber":"79","addr:postcode":"210005","addr:street":"中山南路","building":"retail","commercial":"shopping_center","description":"创建于1936年，是南京历史悠久的“中华老字号”百货商店，现发展为集购物、餐饮、娱乐于一体的现代商业综合体。","description:de":"Das 1936 gegründete Kaufhaus ist ein historisches Traditionsunternehmen („China Time-honored Brand“) in Nanjing, das sich heute zu einem modernen Geschäftskomplex mit Einkaufsmöglichkeiten, Gastronomie und Unterhaltung entwickelt hat.","description:en":"Founded in 1936, it is a historic \"China Time-honored Brand\" department store in Nanjing, now developed into a modern commercial complex integrating shopping, dining, and entertainment.","description:es":"Fundados en 1936, estos históricos grandes almacenes con el sello de \"Marca China de Antaño\" en Nankín se han transformado en un moderno complejo comercial que integra tiendas, restauración y ocio.","description:fr":"Fondé en 1936, ce grand magasin historique bénéficiant du label « Enseigne chinoise de renom » à Nankin est aujourd'hui devenu un complexe commercial moderne combinant boutiques, restaurants et divertissements.","description:ja":"1936年に創業された南京の歴史ある「中華老字号」百貨店で、現在はショッピング、グルメ、エンターテインメントが一体となった現代的な商業コンプレックスに発展しています。","description:ko":"1936년에 설립된 난징의 역사 깊은 '중화라오쯔하오(대물림 상점)' 백화점으로, 현재는 쇼핑, 외식, 엔터테인먼트가 어우러진 현대적인 상업 복합단지로 발전했습니다.","description:pt":"Fundados em 1936, estes históricos grandes armazéns com o selo de \"Marca Chinesa de Tradição\" em Nanquim transformaram-se num moderno complexo comercial que integra lojas, restauração e entretenimento.","description:ru":"Основанный в 1936 году, этот исторический универмаг со статусом «Заслуженная китайская марка» в Нанкине сегодня превратился в современный коммерческий комплекс, объединяющий магазины, рестораны и развлечения.","description:zh":"创建于1936年，是南京历史悠久的“中华老字号”百货商店，现发展为集购物、餐饮、娱乐于一体的现代商业综合体。","description:zh-Hans":"创建于1936年，是南京历史悠久的“中华老字号”百货商店，现发展为集购物、餐饮、娱乐于一体的现代商业综合体。","description:zh-Hant":"創建於1936年，是南京歷史悠久的「中華老字號」百貨商店，現發展為集購物、餐飲、娛樂於一體的現代商業綜合體。","description:zh-Latn-pinyin":"Chuàngjiàn yú 1936 nián, shì Nánjīng lìshǐ yōujiǔ de \"Zhōnghuá Lǎozìhào\" bǎihuò shāngdiàn, xiàn fāzhǎn wéi jí gòuwù, cānyǐn, yúlè yú yītǐ de xiàndài shāngyè zōnghétǐ.","height":"40","name":"中央商场","name:de":"Zentrales Kaufhaus","name:en":"Central Emporium","name:es":"Grandes almacenes centrales","name:fr":"Grand magasin central","name:ja":"中央商場","name:ko":"중앙 상장","name:pt":"Grandes armazéns centrais","name:ru":"Центральный универмаг","name:zh":"中央商场","name:zh-Hans":"中央商场","name:zh-Hant":"中央商場","name:zh-Latn-pinyin":"Zhōngyāng Shāngchǎng","official_name":"南京中央商场","opening_hours":"Mo-Su 10:00-22:00","phone":"+86 25 87418288","shop":"department_store","source":"survey;official_records","start_date":"1936","tourism":"attraction","wikidata":"Q10875053","wikipedia":"zh:中央商场_(南京)"}},{"type":"way","id":321792555,"center":{"lat":32.0340025,"lon":118.7800928},"tags":{"name":"曾公祠","tourism":"attraction"}},{"type":"way","id":323405868,"center":{"lat":32.0304879,